["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Walter Russell Mead - How America Keeps Winning - [Invest Like the Best, EP.490] Tech Hamiltonian info-structure Jacksonian soft blockade\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-ilt-让对手依赖你的体系-是美国赢了三百年的秘密/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aa91f50130802ffe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>让对手依赖你的体系，是美国赢了三百年的秘密</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">荷兰、英国、美国轮番当老大，靠的不是封锁而是让对手把身家性命押进自己的海洋体系——等它们离不开航路与市场，切断就成了战争之外最有效的杀手锏。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美博弈</span><span class=\"tag\">海洋霸权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Ep 221 Electroconvulsive Therapy Part 2: A current conversation Catatonia Anti-NMDA receptor encephalitis Succinylcholine Retrograde amnesia Transcranial magnetic stimulation (TMS)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-tpwky-ect-不是你想的那样-从密室到常规治疗的百年漂移/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>ECT 不是你想的那样：从密室到常规治疗的百年漂移</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">现代 ECT 是在麻醉和肌肉松弛剂下进行的程序，疗效显著，但有关记忆丧失的副作用证据仍不完全清楚，社会对此的误解导致它被过度污名化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">精神科</span><span class=\"tag\">电休克疗法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"288: How Do I Help My Disorganized Teen? executive functioning time blindness metacognition natural consequences\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-asklisa-孩子丢三落四不是懒-是前额叶还没长好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/747ab52ea57af87e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">37:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>孩子丢三落四不是懒，是前额叶还没长好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">14岁男孩的前额叶要到25岁才发育完，所以丢三落四不是态度问题。真正的问题是：家长自己的执行功能也不够用，却要替孩子搭一套他根本撑不住的系统。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年心理</span><span class=\"tag\">执行功能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"End of the Day Crazies With Kids party hat / professional hat yes time\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-unruffled-孩子放学回家就发疯-不是他变坏了-是他终于安全了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">27:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>孩子放学回家就发疯，不是他变坏了，是他终于安全了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子把一天的压力全部倒给最亲的人，是正常且健康的；父母这时要戴的不是陪玩的「派对帽」，而是立规矩的「职业帽」，那才是真正的优质时间。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">情绪调节</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"我们如何老去？从《前浪》窥见中国老年生活的真实图景 意定监护 躯体化 失独家庭 空巢老人\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-cn300980-纪录片导演说-没有典型的老年-只有一个个具体的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda8c0f9bba83da6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"不\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">不合时宜</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>纪录片导演说：没有典型的老年，只有一个个具体的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">拍了两季《前浪》的范世广说，大多数婚姻走到最后是不咸不淡甚至不好的，白头偕老是凤毛麟角；我们最缺的不是故事，是钱，和把老人当具体的人看。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">老龄化</span><span class=\"tag\">照护</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"谷歌AI风云15年：诸神黄昏——发明未来的人为何错过未来？ Transformer TPU 强化学习 稀疏模型 思维链 NeoLab\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-cnf65bb3-谷歌发明了-transformer-却把大模型时代让给了-openai/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/216e9fe2cae1cec8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"科\"><span class=\"dur\">2:24:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">科技这碗饭</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>谷歌发明了 Transformer，却把大模型时代让给了 OpenAI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">谷歌手里同时握着 Transformer、TPU 和最多算力，却因为搜索广告的包袱和两支 AI 团队的内耗，把语言模型这条最关键的赛道让给了 OpenAI。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">谷歌</span><span class=\"tag\">DeepMind</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Blowing Up Your Life jolt collateral jolt nuclear events divergent thinking convergent thinking three B&#x27;s\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-hiddenbrain-一次意外就能让你看清人生-但冲动辞职多半会后悔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda02344d4b647e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Brain</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>一次意外就能让你看清人生，但冲动辞职多半会后悔</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人生转折点往往不是理性权衡的结果，而是一次意外事件把人踢出自动驾驶状态；但研究显示，冲动辞职多半会后悔，最聪明的反应有时是原地不动。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">职业决策</span><span class=\"tag\">心理学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Six Impossible Episodes: Back-to-Court Substantial Disruption Test Establishment Clause reasonable suspicion probable cause corporal punishment closed-circuit recipients\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-stuffmissed-美国最高法院先给了学生宪法权利-后来又把搜包和体罚还给校园/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>美国最高法院先给了学生宪法权利，后来又把搜包和体罚还给校园</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">从拒绝向国旗敬礼到搜书包，六个判例逐渐画出美国公立学校学生的宪法权利；最高法院一边立下「学校不是极权飞地」，一边承认体罚与合理怀疑搜包不违宪，权利边界由此缩小。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国最高法院</span><span class=\"tag\">第一修正案</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"321. The Respect Effect: What Stereotype Threat Teaches Us About Communication stereotype threat churn disidentify\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-thinkfast-批评想被听进去-先给高期待与信任/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3e35d57ca15b5b1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">20:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Think Fast Talk Smart</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>批评想被听进去，先给高期待与信任</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">批评想被采信，靠的不是先夸几句，而是让对方看到：标准是高的、你是有潜力的。实验中只一句「标准高但你能达到」，黑人学生的改稿行动率就冲到最高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">刻板印象威胁</span><span class=\"tag\">反馈沟通</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"367 | Jared Diamond on the Course of History and the Role of leaders natural experiment ANOVA regression to the mean dendrochronology\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-mindscape-希特勒死于1930年车祸-二战还会发生吗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>希特勒死于1930年车祸，二战还会发生吗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jared Diamond 用自然实验回答「领袖何时重要」：CEO 大约解释 30% 的利润差异，而体育教练最大的作用不是战术，是训练球员别犯规。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">领导力</span><span class=\"tag\">历史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Meritocracy, Exams, and the Knowledge That Matters (with Daisy Christodoulou) eight-legged essay far transfer near transfer identical elements mental discipline Northcote-Trevelyan Report\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-econtalk-拉丁文练不出外科医生-考试难-不如考得有用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>拉丁文练不出外科医生：考试难，不如考得有用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">拉丁文练不出外科医生：技能几乎不迁移。如果认定「越难越能磨脑」，一国最聪明的人会被浪费在最无用的知识上——这就是清代科考的教训。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育</span><span class=\"tag\">考试制度</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can Open Source Keep AI Power From Concentrating? Attention is All You Need ensemble\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-a16z-ai-权力集中只是当下技术的结果-不是终局/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">8:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>AI 权力集中只是当下技术的结果，不是终局</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Transformer 靠海量数据和算力才聪明，所以权力集中在买得起数据中心的大公司手里；但 Transformer 还不到十年，人类大脑就是小数据专家的存在证明。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.234 宏观漫谈110｜全球流动性的困境与中国五类经济主体的金融结构转型（9.2录制） Capex FOMO Mega 7\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-cn38ff4a-全球流动性见顶-上半年越激进砸-ai-的公司-越先被折价/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c8ab7cfc7806449c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"高\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">高能量</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>全球流动性见顶：上半年越激进砸 AI 的公司，越先被折价</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">资本市场的上涨必须有新钱持续接盘。全球流动性已经露出见顶迹象，上半年最激进投 AI 的公司，正从被奖励变为被折价。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">流动性</span><span class=\"tag\">AI资本开支</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Money Launderers Love $100 Bills seigniorage trade-based money laundering Vancouver model banknote paradox SAR (Suspicious Activity Report)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-oddlots-央行不愿废除百元美钞-那是一笔-2-5-万亿无息贷款/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">54:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>央行不愿废除百元美钞：那是一笔 2.5 万亿无息贷款</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">现金使用越来越少，流通中的美元却创新高。央行有动力继续印 100 美元纸钞：这笔钱实质是美国政府 2.5 万亿美元的无息贷款，代价是给全球洗钱者提供便利。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">洗钱</span><span class=\"tag\">反洗钱</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Are Rumors of an Imminent Russian Attack Warranted? | Yaroslav Trofimov Article 5 Suwalki Gap Minsk-1 / Minsk-2 Operation Spiderweb\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-hiddenforces-俄罗斯陷在乌克兰-仍有余力对北约开新战线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b4203c8f6331570-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">49:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Forces</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>俄罗斯陷在乌克兰，仍有余力对北约开新战线</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">俄军在乌克兰没有取胜，但消耗战喂出了世界最尖端的无人机步兵战经验；嘉宾认为它完全有余力对北约发动一次有限试探，窗口就在特朗普任期的最后阶段。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄乌战争</span><span class=\"tag\">地缘政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep. 399: Dan Dennett&#x27;s Model of Mind (Part Two) multiple drafts model heterophenomenology phi phenomenon qualia illusionism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-pel-意识不是剧场-dennett-说体验就是判断本身/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1e15495695462c4f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>意识不是剧场：Dennett 说体验就是判断本身</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dennett 的「多重草稿」模型否认大脑里有个中央屏幕：没有「先感觉、后判断」两步，体验本身就是一堆并行判断的蒸馏物。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心灵哲学</span><span class=\"tag\">意识</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Why Your Preschooler Is Hitting, Biting, or Kicking (And What Helps) autonomy kindergarten readiness accommodation power-over model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-parentmojo-孩子打咬踢不是坏行为-是在夺回身体自主权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">21:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>孩子打咬踢不是坏行为，是在夺回身体自主权</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">别再问怎么让打人停止。三四岁孩子的打咬踢，常常是身体被成人几乎掌控一切后，仅剩的喊出「我没有发言权」的工具——给回一点选择，行为才会减少。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">学龄前</span><span class=\"tag\">幼儿攻击行为</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Flood that Wrecked the Hard Disk Drive Industry industrial estate slider La Niña cartelize\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-06-asianometry-泰国洪水重创硬盘业-最大的厂跌倒-老二捡了王座/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cdd681ba1ae2c3c7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">19:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>泰国洪水重创硬盘业：最大的厂跌倒，老二捡了王座</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">泰国一场洪水改写了硬盘座次：最大厂 Western Digital 出货环比跌51%，Seagate 只跌8%，反超登顶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬盘</span><span class=\"tag\">泰国</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"393. Road To 9/11: Interviewing Bin Laden In The Caves of Tora Bora (Part 5) fatwa Alec Station B-roll PNG\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-06-empirehist-本-拉登1997年就宣战了-美国四年后才听懂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">47:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>本·拉登1997年就宣战了，美国四年后才听懂</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1997年CNN拍下本·拉登首次电视宣战，当时几乎无人注意；真正让美国醒过来的是1998年两座使馆被炸——他要的不是很多人看，是很多人死。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">反恐</span><span class=\"tag\">情报机构</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1355: Four billion years of AI training data E-value healthy vaccinee bias genomic language model AS01 adjuvant compensation mutation phage cocktail\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-06-twiv-ai-设计出能感染细菌的病毒-但成功率仅-5/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">1:38:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>AI 设计出能感染细菌的病毒，但成功率仅 5%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 第一次从头设计出能感染细菌的完整病毒基因组；实验验证成功率只有约 5%，远没有媒体说的那么全能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI病毒设计</span><span class=\"tag\">噬菌体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Nvidia Is Betting on Its Customers. Gen Z Is Betting on Sports. Will It All End the Same Way? zero DTE options SPV equity method mosaic effect\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-06-excessreturns-体育博彩渗透z世代-金融监管风险被低估/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cac5e72b6049e76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">55:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Excess Returns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>体育博彩渗透Z世代，金融监管风险被低估</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">体育博彩正成为Z世代财务策略的一部分，其缓慢损失比一次性大亏更难恢复，且与金融产品同处一平台，未来监管风险被普遍低估。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">体育博彩</span><span class=\"tag\">Z世代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Ion Drives: The Slow Rockets That Win Space ion drive specific impulse (ISP) delta V Hall thruster Oberth effect\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-06-isaacarthur-离子推进-慢慢推-反而赢下太空竞速/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cb30183de345fa0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">IsaacArthur</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>离子推进：慢慢推，反而赢下太空竞速</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">火箭不一定越猛越好。离子引擎推力小到像一张纸，却能连续工作数年，用极少的推进剂积累出化学火箭做不到的速度，成为太空物流的主力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">离子推进</span><span class=\"tag\">电推进</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why companies are becoming a series of loops | Anish Acharya (a16z) loop autocatalytic effects recursive self-improvement\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-06-lennys-公司变成一串自动循环-ai-能到坡顶-换山还得靠人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9071c4e5c21eb753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>公司变成一串自动循环：AI 能到坡顶，换山还得靠人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">公司正在被改造成一串互相咬合的循环；循环可以把当前业务推到局部最优，但在平台期之后，选下一座山仍要靠人类直觉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 应用</span><span class=\"tag\">消费 AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Your AI Doctor Is Coming | Julie Yoo leapfrog dynamic AI native and AI proof N of one AI scribes third-party payer system\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-06-a16z-医疗没建过中间件-反而能直接跳到-ai-原生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">27:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>医疗没建过中间件，反而能直接跳到 AI 原生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国医疗是科技投入占收入比最低的行业，没铺过 SaaS 中间层，所以没有沉没成本要拆——这是它第一次出现医生自发使用技术的有机采纳潮。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗AI</span><span class=\"tag\">数字健康</span>\n</div></div></a>"]